{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"pilot","tool":"container_exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /work/artifacts/phase2_prompt_packs/prob_13_9/semantic_review_context_v1.md","timeout_seconds":30},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"exit_code\": 0, \"timed_out\": false, \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.21900000001187436, \"stdout\": \"# Semantic Review Context for prob_13_9\\n\\nThis file is the authoritative review context for `review-pack` and `review-existing`.\\nA local build is not enough: the reviewer must check statement fidelity, proof spine adequacy, interface contract, and downstream adequacy against this context.\\n\\n## Original Task Text\\n\\n- Type: `Problem`\\n- Source plan: `experiment_targets`\\n- Title: `Problem 13.9`\\n\\n\\\\textbf{13.9.} Suppose (X n)n\\\\geq0 is a sequence of random variables defined on a probability\\n\\nspace (we take X 0 = 0 as the initial rv.)For n \\\\geq 1, let\\n\\nYn \\\\coloneqqX n -E [Xn\\\\vertX0,X 1,...,X n- 1].\\n\\nThe random variable Y n can be interpreted as the new information contained in X n\\n\\nrelative to the information contained in the past X 0,...,X n- 1Let Sn denote the\\n\\npartial sum S n \\\\coloneqqY 1 +Y 2 +\\\\cdot\\\\cdot\\\\cdot+ Yn for n \\\\geq 1 and S 0 = 0. Show that (S n)n\\\\geq0 is a\\n\\nmartingale relative to the filtration (\\\\sigma(X 1,X 2,...,X n))n\\\\geq0.\\n\\n## Upstream Textbook Chain\\n\\n- No declared upstream textbook tasks.\\n\\n## Direct Downstream Consumers\\n\\n- No direct downstream consumers were found in current plans.\\n\\n## Current Public Interface Summary\\n\\n- Output owner task: `prob_13_9`\\n- Official Lean module: `ProbabilityTheory.chapter_13.prob_13_9`\\n- Official output targets: `/work/ProbabilityTheoryFormalization/ProbabilityTheory/chapter_13/prob_13_9.lean, /work/artifacts/output_lean_files/general/prob_13_9.lean, /work/artifacts/output_lean_files/experiment_targets/prob_13_9.lean`\\n- Task-scoped official declarations: `(not policy-mapped)`\\n- Recorded exported symbols: `(none recorded)`\\n- Current ledger status: `PACKED`\\n- Build candidate state: `build_ready`\\n- Last completed semantic review result: `(none)`\\n\\n## Allowed Abstraction Layer\\n\\n- 可以在证明内部调用 Mathlib 或已有测度论/积分论引理，但导出的 theorem/definition statement 必须忠实对应教材对象。\\n\\n## Forbidden Weakenings\\n\\n- 禁止把教材中的公共接口偷换成纯存在性壳、占位定义或只记录 witness 的结构。\\n- 禁止把应当供下游复用的 theorem 改写成只够当前文件自证的 theorem-specific wrapper。\\n\\n## Historical Shortcut / Shell Risks\\n\\n- No task-specific historical shortcut is recorded; still enforce the general forbidden weakenings above.\\n\\n## Downstream Acceptance Checklist\\n\\n- No extra downstream checklist recorded beyond the general rubric.\\n\\n## Pack Snapshot\\n\\n- Pack directory: `/work/artifacts/phase2_prompt_packs/prob_13_9`\\n- Context markdown: `/work/artifacts/phase2_prompt_packs/prob_13_9/context.md`\\n- Search manifest: `/work/artifacts/phase2_prompt_packs/prob_13_9/search_manifest.json`\\n- Intent contract: `/work/artifacts/phase2_prompt_packs/prob_13_9/intent_contract.json`\\n\", \"stderr\": \"\", \"stdout_truncated\": false, \"stderr_truncated\": false, \"raw_stdout\": {\"bytes\": 2723, \"sha256\": \"b3e51ffb782cd826b625e6325f7064dcfb6e734a2678740ba8cd25267742975a\"}, \"raw_stderr\": {\"bytes\": 0, \"sha256\": \"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\"}}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
